#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QGroupBox, groupBox5)
#: dialogs/PositionWidget.ui:176
msgid ""
"When checked, this has the same effect as Data ->Merge Cells. You need to "
"have at least two consecutive cells selected. Those consecutive cells are "
"then merged into a bigger one.\n"
"When a merged cell is selected and when you uncheck this, then all cells "
"come back to their original size as before the merging. It has the same "
"effect as Data -> Dissociate Cells."
msgstr ""
"Wenn dit anmaakt is, hett dat de sülve Utwarken as \"Daten -> Zellen "
"tosamenföhren\". Een mutt tominnst twee nevenenanner liggen Zellen utsöken. "
"Disse Zellen warrt denn na en grötter Zell tosamenföhrt.\n"
"Wenn Een en tosamenföhrt Zell markeert un dit utmaakt warrt, stellt de Zell "
"ehr Orginaalgrött ehr't Tosamenföhren wedder her. Dit hatt de sülve Utwarken "
"as \"Daten -> Zellen trennen\"."

