#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QWidget, ProtectionWidget)
#: dialogs/ProtectionWidget.ui:34
msgid ""
"This tab enables you to set Cell Protection. All cells are protected by "
"default (that means cell content cannot be changed) and for the cell "
"protection to be active you also need to protect the sheet using the Tools -"
"> Protect Document -> Protect Sheet... menu and to provide a password.\n"
"You can also hide the cell formula in order to protect the way you calculate "
"the formula. This also needs to enable sheet protection to work.\n"
"You can hide the cell content with Hide all and again this needs sheet "
"protection.\n"
"You can learn more about all these settings in the User Manual in the "
"Advanced KCells chapter."
msgstr ""
"Mit disse Koort lett sik de Zellschuul fastleggen. Standardwies sünd all "
"Zellen schuult (dat bedüüdt, dat sik de Zellinholt nich ännern lett), un "
"dormit de Zellschuul aktiv warrt, mutt de Tabell ok noch mit dat Menü "
"\"Warktüüch -> Dokment schulen -> Tabell schulen...\" mit en Passwoort "
"schuult wesen.\n"
"De Zellformel lett sik ok versteken, dormit sik de Utrekenmetood för de "
"Formel nich rutfinnen lett. Dor mutt de Tabell ok för schuult wesen.\n"
"De Zellinholt lett sik mit de Funkschoon \"All versteken\" ok versteken. Ok "
"dor mutt de Tabell för schuult wesen.\n"
"Binnen den Afsnitt \"Verwiedert\" in't Brukerhandbook vun KCells lett sik "
"mehr över disse Instellen finnen."

#. i18n: ectx: property (title), widget (QGroupBox, groupBox2)
#: dialogs/ProtectionWidget.ui:40
msgid "Printing"
msgstr "Drucken"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, m_bDontPrint)
#: dialogs/ProtectionWidget.ui:47
msgid ""
"If checked, the content of the cell will not be printed. If this is not "
"checked (default), the cell content will be printed.\n"
"Note that you can print it even if the cell is protected"
msgstr ""
"Wenn dit anmaakt is, warrt de Zellinholt nich druckt. Wenn dit nich anmaakt "
"is (Standard), warrt de Zellinholt druckt.\n"
"Beacht, dat he sik ok drucken lett, wenn de Zell schuult is"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, m_bDontPrint)
#: dialogs/ProtectionWidget.ui:50
msgid "&Do not print text"
msgstr "Text nich &drucken"

#. i18n: ectx: property (title), widget (QGroupBox, groupBox1)
#: dialogs/ProtectionWidget.ui:60
msgid "Protection"
msgstr "Schuul"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, m_bHideAll)
#: dialogs/ProtectionWidget.ui:68
msgid ""
"This hides the cell content and works only when the sheet is protected. "
"Whether the cell itself is protected or not does not matter."
msgstr ""
"Dit versteekt den Zellinholt un arbeidt bloots, wenn de Tabell schuult is, "
"eendoont, wat de Zell sülvst schuult is oder nich."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, m_bHideAll)
#: dialogs/ProtectionWidget.ui:71
msgid "Hide &all"
msgstr "&All versteken"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, m_bIsProtected)
#: dialogs/ProtectionWidget.ui:96
msgid ""
"If checked, the cell content will be protected. This is the default "
"behavior. You need to protect the whole sheet using the Tools->Protect "
"document->Protect Sheet... menu option for this individual cell protection "
"to work. See the manual for more details in the Advanced KCells chapter. "
"When a cell is protected, its content cannot be changed."
msgstr ""
"Wenn dit anmaakt is, warrt de Zellinholt schuult. Dit is dat "
"Standardbedregen. Dormit disse Enkelzellschuul arbeidt, mutt de heel Tabell "
"mit \"Warktüüch -> Dokment schulen -> Tabell schulen\" schuult wesen. Binnen "
"den Afsnitt \"Verwiedert\" in't Brukerhandbook vun KCells lett sik mehr över "
"disse Instellen finnen. Wenn en Zell schuult is, lett sik ehr Inholt nich "
"ännern."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, m_bIsProtected)
#: dialogs/ProtectionWidget.ui:99
msgid "&Protected"
msgstr "&Schuult"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, m_bHideFormula)
#: dialogs/ProtectionWidget.ui:129
msgid ""
"When this is checked, the cell is still visible. However, its contents do "
"not appear in the Formula bar. Hiding formula is only working for cells that "
"contain formulae so the user cannot view the formula. And the sheet must be "
"protected for this to work."
msgstr ""
"Is dit anmaakt, lett sik de Zell noch ankieken, man ehr Inholt warrt nich "
"binnen den Formelbalken wiest. Formeln laat sik vör den Bruker bloots "
"versteken, wenn de Zellen Formeln bargt un de Tabell schuult is."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, m_bHideFormula)
#: dialogs/ProtectionWidget.ui:132
msgid "&Hide formula"
msgstr "Formel &versteken"

#: dialogs/SeriesDialog.cpp:52
msgid "Series"
msgstr "Reeg"

#: dialogs/SeriesDialog.cpp:64
msgid "Insert Values"
msgstr "Weerten infögen"

#: dialogs/SeriesDialog.cpp:68
msgid "Insert the series vertically, one below the other"
msgstr "De Reeg pielrecht infögen, vun baven na nerrn"

#: dialogs/SeriesDialog.cpp:70
msgid "Insert the series horizontally, from left to right"
msgstr "De Reeg kimmrecht infögen, vun links na rechts"

#: dialogs/SeriesDialog.cpp:76
msgid "Type"
msgstr "Typ"

#: dialogs/SeriesDialog.cpp:79
msgid "Linear (2,4,6,...)"
msgstr "Lineaar (2, 4, 6, ...)"

#: dialogs/SeriesDialog.cpp:80
msgid ""
"Generate a series from 'start' to 'end' and for each step add the value "
"provided in step. This creates a series where each value is 'step' larger "
"than the value before it."
msgstr ""
"En Reeg vun \"Start\" na \"Enn\" opstellen un jümmers den för \"Schritt\" "
"angeven Weert tofögen. Dor kummt denn en Reeg bi rut, bi de elk nakamen "
"Weert üm \"Schritt\" grötter is as de vörangahn Weert."

#: dialogs/SeriesDialog.cpp:83
msgid "Geometric (2,4,8,...)"
msgstr "Geometersch (2, 4, 8, ...)"

#: dialogs/SeriesDialog.cpp:84
msgid ""
"Generate a series from 'start' to 'end' and for each step multiply the value "
"with the value provided in step. Using a step of 5 produces a list like: 5, "
"25, 125, 625 since 5 multiplied by 5 (step) equals 25, and that multiplied "
"by 5 equals 125, which multiplied by the same step-value of 5 equals 625."
msgstr ""
"En Reeg vun \"Start\" na \"Enn\" opstellen un jümmers mit den för \"Schritt"
"\" angeven Weert maalnehmen. Mit en Schritt vun \"5\" gifft dat en List liek "
"5, 25, 125, 625, wiel 5 maal 5 (Schritt) 25 maakt, un dat maal 5 denn 125, "
"un dat denn wedder maal den Schritt 5 625."

#: dialogs/SeriesDialog.cpp:97
msgid "Start value:"
msgstr "Startweert:"

#: dialogs/SeriesDialog.cpp:103
msgid "Stop value:"
msgstr "Ennweert:"

#: dialogs/SeriesDialog.cpp:109
msgid "Step value:"
msgstr "Schrittweert:"

#: dialogs/SeriesDialog.cpp:143
msgid "End and start value must be positive."
msgstr "Enn- un Startweert mööt positiv wesen."

#: dialogs/SeriesDialog.cpp:147
msgid ""
"End value must be greater than the start value or the step must be less than "
"'1'."
msgstr ""
"De Ennweert mutt grötter as de Startweert wesen, oder de Schritt mutt lütter "
"as \"1\" wesen."

#: dialogs/SeriesDialog.cpp:152
msgid "None of the Start, Stop or Step values may be equal to zero."
msgstr "Start-, Enn- oder Schrittweerten mööt nich \"0\" wesen."

#: dialogs/SeriesDialog.cpp:157
msgid "Step value must be different from 1"
msgstr "Schrittweert mutt nich \"1\" wesen"

#: dialogs/SeriesDialog.cpp:161
msgid "Step is negative."
msgstr "Schritt is negativ."

#: dialogs/SeriesDialog.cpp:168
msgid ""
"The step value must be greater than zero; otherwise, the linear series is "
"infinite."
msgstr ""
"De Schrittweert mutt grötter as Null wesen, anners gifft dat en lineaar Reeg "
"ahn Enn."

#: dialogs/SeriesDialog.cpp:173
msgid ""
"If the start value is greater than the end value the step must be less than "
"zero."
msgstr ""
"Wenn de Startweert grötter as de Ennweert is, mutt de Schritt lütter as Null "
"wesen."

#: dialogs/SeriesDialog.cpp:178
msgid ""
"If the step is negative, the start value must be greater then the end value."
msgstr ""
"Wenn de Schritt negativ is, mutt de Startweert grötter as de Ennweert wesen."

