msgid "Second number"
msgstr "Tweet Tall"

#: functions/bitops.xml:19
msgid ""
"The BITAND() function performs a bit-wise AND operation for the two integer "
"parameters."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon BITAND() föhrt en bitwies AND-Operatschoon för de twee "
"Heeltall-Parameters ut."

#: functions/bitops.xml:20
msgid "BITAND(value; value)"
msgstr "BITAND(Weert; Weert)"

#: functions/bitops.xml:21
msgid ""
"BITAND(12;10) returns 8 (because decimal 12 is binary 1100, and decimal 10 "
"is binary 1010; and 1100 \"anded\" with 1010 is 1000, which is integer 8)."
msgstr ""
"BITAND(12;10) gifft 8 torüch (wiel dezimaal 12 bineer 1100 is, un dezimaal "
"10 bineer 1010 is. 1100 AND 1010 is 1000, un dat is de Heeltall 8)."

#: functions/bitops.xml:34
msgid "Amount to left shift by"
msgstr "Tall vun Versatzsteden na links"

#: functions/bitops.xml:38
msgid ""
"The BITLSHIFT() function performs a bit-wise left shift operation of the "
"first parameter. The number of bits to shift by is specified by the second "
"parameter. Note that a negative number of bits to left shift by becomes a "
"right shift. "
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon BITLSHIFT() verschufft den eersten Parameter bitwies na links. "
"De Bitversatzsteden warrt dör den tweten Parameter angeven. Beacht, dat en "
"negativ Bitverschuven-Weert na links en Bitverschuven na rechts bedüüdt."

#: functions/bitops.xml:39
msgid "BITLSHIFT(value; shift size)"
msgstr "BITLSHIFT(Weert, Versatzgrött)"

#: functions/bitops.xml:52
msgid "Amount to right shift by"
msgstr "Tall vun Versatzsteden na rechts"

#: functions/bitops.xml:56
msgid ""
"The BITRSHIFT() function performs a bit-wise right shift operation of the "
"first parameter. The number of bits to shift by is specified by the second "
"parameter. Note that a negative number of bits to right shift by becomes a "
"left shift. "
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon BITRSHIFT() verschufft den eersten Parameter bitwies na "
"rechts. De Bitversatzsteden warrt dör den tweten Parameter angeven. Beacht, "
"dat en negativ Bitverschuven-Weert na rechts en Bitverschuven na links "
"bedüüdt."

#: functions/bitops.xml:57
msgid "BITRSHIFT(value; shift size)"
msgstr "BITRSHIFT(Weert, Versatzgrött)"

#: functions/bitops.xml:74
msgid ""
"The BITOR() function performs a bit-wise OR operation for the two integer "
"parameters. "
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon BITOR() föhrt en bitwies OR-Operatschoon för de twee Heeltall-"
"Parameters ut. "

#: functions/bitops.xml:75
msgid "BITOR(value; value)"
msgstr "BITOR(Weert; Weert)"

#: functions/bitops.xml:76
msgid ""
"BITOR(12;10) returns 14 (because decimal 12 is binary 1100, and decimal 10 "
"is binary 1010; and 1100 \"ored\" with 1010 is 1110, which is integer 14)."
msgstr ""
"BITOR(12;10) gifft 14 torüch (wiel dezimaal 12 bineer 1100 is, un dezimaal "
"10 bineer 1010 is. 1100 OR 1010 is 1100, un dat is de Heeltall 14)."

#: functions/bitops.xml:93
msgid ""
"The BITXOR() function performs a bit-wise exclusive-OR operation for the two "
"integer parameters. "
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon BITXOR() föhrt en bitwies XOR-Operatschoon för de twee "
"Heeltall-Parameters ut. "

#: functions/bitops.xml:94
msgid "BITXOR(value; value)"
msgstr "BITXOR(Weert; Weert)"

#: functions/bitops.xml:95
msgid ""
"BITXOR(12;10) returns 6 (because decimal 12 is binary 1100, and decimal 10 "
"is binary 1010; and 1100 \"xored\" with 1010 is 0110, which is integer 6)."
msgstr ""
"BITXOR(12;10) gifft 6 torüch (wiel dezimaal 12 bineer 1100 is, un dezimaal "
"10 bineer 1010 is. 1100 XOR 1010 is 0110, un dat is de Heeltall 6)."

