msgid ""
"PMT returns the amount of payment for a loan based on a constant interest "
"rate and constant payments (each payment is equal amount)."
msgstr ""
"PMT gifft den Tahlbedrag för en Kredit mit fast Tinssatz un fast "
"Torüchtahlen (jümmers de sülven Raten) torüch."

#: functions/financial.xml:1007
msgid "PMT(rate; nper ; pv [; fv = 0 [; type = 0 ]] )"
msgstr "PMT(Tins; NPer ; PV [; FV = 0 [; Typ = 0 ]] )"

#: functions/financial.xml:1008
msgid "PMT(0.1; 4; 10000) equals -3154.71"
msgstr "PMT(0.1; 4; 10000) gifft \"-3154.71\" torüch"

#: functions/financial.xml:1044
msgid ""
"PPMT calculates the amount of a payment of an annuity going towards "
"principal."
msgstr ""
"PPMT reekt den Utbetahlbedrag för en Rent vun en Kapitaaltorüchtahlen ut."

#: functions/financial.xml:1051
msgid "PPMT(Rate; Period; NPer; PV [; FV = 9 [; Type = 0 ]] )"
msgstr "PPMT(Tins; Periood; NPer; PV [; FV = 9 [; Typ = 0 ]] )"

#: functions/financial.xml:1052
msgid "PPMT(0.0875;1;36;5000;8000;1) equals -18.48"
msgstr "PPMT(0.0875;1;36;5000;8000;1) gifft \"-18.48\" torüch"

#: functions/financial.xml:1071 functions/financial.xml:1444
msgid "Issue"
msgstr "Utgaav"

#: functions/financial.xml:1075 functions/financial.xml:1161
#: functions/financial.xml:1266 functions/financial.xml:1290
#: functions/financial.xml:1448
msgid "Discount rate"
msgstr "Diskontsatz"

#: functions/financial.xml:1087
msgid ""
"PRICEMAT Calculate the price per 100 currency units of face value of the "
"security that pays interest on the maturity date."
msgstr ""
"PRICEMAT reekt den Pries för 100 Geldeenheiten vun den Nennweert vun dat "
"Weertpapeer, dat an't Utbetahldatum Tinsen betahlt, ut."

#: functions/financial.xml:1088
msgid "Basis     Calculation method"
msgstr "Basis           Utrekenmetood"

#: functions/financial.xml:1089
msgid "  0       US method, 12 months, each month with 30 days"
msgstr "  0       US-Metood, 12 Maanden, elk Maand mit 30 Daag"

#: functions/financial.xml:1090
msgid ""
"  1       Actual number of days in year, actual number of days in months "
msgstr ""
"  1       Redig Tall vun Daag in't Johr, redig Tall vun Daag in Maanden "

#: functions/financial.xml:1091
msgid "  2       360 days in a year, actual number of days in months"
msgstr "  2       360 Daag in't Johr, redig Tall vun Daag in Maanden"

#: functions/financial.xml:1092
msgid "  4       365 days in a year,  actual number of days in months"
msgstr "  4       365 Daag in't Johr,  redig Tall vun Daag in Maanden"

#: functions/financial.xml:1093
msgid "  5       European method, 12 months, each month has 30 days"
msgstr "  5       Europääsch Metood, 12 Maanden, elk Maand mit 30 Daag"

#: functions/financial.xml:1094
msgid "PRICEMAT(settlement; maturity; issue; rate; yield [; basis = 0 ] )"
msgstr ""
"PRICEMAT(Utbetahldatum; Afloopdatum; Utgaav; Tins; Winn [; Basis = 0 ] )"

#: functions/financial.xml:1095
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"PRICEMAT(DATE(1990;6;1);DATE(1995;12;31);DATE(1990;1;1);6%;5%) returns "
"103.819218241"
msgstr ""
"PRICEMAT(DATE(1990;6;1);DATE(1995;12;31);DATE(1990;1;1);6%;5%) gifft "
"103.819218241 torüch."

#: functions/financial.xml:1105
msgid "Future value"
msgstr "Tokamen Weert"

#: functions/financial.xml:1117
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The PV() function returns the present value of an investment -- the value "
"today of a sum of money in the future, given the rate of interest or "
"inflation. For example if you need $1166.40 for your new computer and you "
"want to buy it in two years while earning 8% interest, you need to start "
"with PV(1166.4;0.08;2) or $1000."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon PV() gifft den aktuellen Weert vun en Geldanlaag torüch. Dat "
"is de Weert vundaag vun en Geldsumm in de Tokunft, fastleggt dör Tins oder "
"Inflatschoon. Wenn Een a.B. 1166,40 Dollar för en niegen Reekner bruukt un "
"em in twee Johren köpen will, bruukt he bi en Tinssatz vun 8% nu PV"
"(1166.4;0.08;2) oder 1000 Dollar."

#: functions/financial.xml:1118
msgid "PV(future value;rate;periods)"
msgstr "PV(Tokamen Weert;Tins;Perioden)"

#: functions/financial.xml:1119
msgid "PV(1166.4;0.08;2) equals 1000"
msgstr "PV(1166,4; 0,08; 2) gifft \"1000\" torüch"

#: functions/financial.xml:1139
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The PV_ANNUITY() function returns the present value of an annuity or stream "
"of payments. For example: a \"million dollar\" lottery ticket that pays "
"$50,000 a year for 20 years, with an interest rate of 5%, is actually worth "
"PV_ANNUITY(50000;0.05;20) or $623,111. This function assumes that payments "
"are made at the end of each period."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon PV_ANNUITY() gifft den aktuellen Weert vun en Rent oder en "
"Geldstroom ut. En \"Een Million\"-Lotterieschien mit en Tinssatz vun 5% a."
"B., de twintig Johr lang 50000 Dollar in't Johr utbetahlt, is nu PV_ANNUITY"
"(50000;0,05;20) oder 623,111 Dollar weert. Disse Funkschoon vermoodt de "
"Utbetahlen an't Enn vun elk Periood."

#: functions/financial.xml:1140
msgid "PV_ANNUITY(amount;interest;periods)"
msgstr "PV_ANNUITY(Bedrag; Tins; Perioden)"

#: functions/financial.xml:1141
msgid "PV_ANNUITY(1000;0.05;5) equals 4329.48"
msgstr "PV_ANNUITY(1000;0,05;5) maakt 4329,48"

#: functions/financial.xml:1169
msgid ""
"The RECEIVED function returns the amount received at the maturity date for a "
"invested security. Basis is the type of day counting you want to use: 0: US "
"30/360 (default), 1: real days, 2: real days/360, 3: real days/365 or 4: "
"European 30/365. The settlement date must be before maturity date."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon RECEIVED gifft den Bedrag torüch, de an't Afloopdatum för en "
"anleggt Weertpapeer ansteiht. Basis is de Oort, wodennig de Daag tellt "
"warrt: 0 = amerikaansch 30/360 (Standard), 1 = reaal Daag, 2 = reaal "
"Daag/360, 3 = reaal Daag/365 oder 4 = europääsch 30/365. Dat Utbetahldatum "
"mutt ehr't Afloopdatum liggen."

#: functions/financial.xml:1170
msgid "RECEIVED(settlement; maturity; investment; discount; basis)"
msgstr ""
"RECEIVED(Utbetahldatum; Afloopdatum; Investitschoon; Diskontsatz; Basis)"

#: functions/financial.xml:1171
msgid "RECEIVED(\"2/28/2001\"; \"8/31/2001\"; 1000; 0.05; 0) returns 1,025.787"
msgstr "RECEIVED(\"2/28/2001\"; \"8/31/2001\"; 1000; 0.05; 0) maakt 1,025.787"

#: functions/financial.xml:1191
msgid ""
"The RRI function calculates the interest rate resulting from the profit "
"(return) of an investment."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon PRI reekt den Tinssatz vun den Winnst vun en Geldanlaag ut."

#: functions/financial.xml:1192
msgid "RRI( P; Pv; Fv)"
msgstr "RRI( P; Pv; Fv)"

#: functions/financial.xml:1193
msgid "RRI(1;100;200) returns 1"
msgstr "RRI(1;100;200) gifft \"1\" torüch"

#: functions/financial.xml:1218
msgid ""
"The SLN() function will determine the straight line depreciation of an asset "
"for a single period. Cost is the amount you paid for the asset. Salvage is "
"the value of the asset at the end of the period. Life is the number of "
"periods over which the asset is depreciated. SLN divides the cost evenly "
"over the life of an asset."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon SLN() reekt de lineaar Afschrieven vun en Anlaag för en "
"enkelte Periood ut. \"Kösten\" is dat, wat Een för de Anlaag betahlt hett. "
"\"Restweert\" is de Anlaag ehr Weert an't Enn vun de Looptiet. \"Looptiet\" "
"is de Tall vun Perioden, över de de Anlaag afschreven is. SLN verdeelt de "
"Kösten egaalweg över de Anlaag ehr heel Looptiet."

#: functions/financial.xml:1219
msgid "SLN(cost; salvage value; life)"
msgstr "SLN(Kösten; Restweert; Looptiet)"

#: functions/financial.xml:1220
msgid "SLN(10000;700;10) equals 930"
msgstr "SLN(10000;700;10) gifft \"930\" torüch"

#: functions/financial.xml:1246
msgid ""
"The SYD() function will calculate the sum-of-years digits depreciation for "
"an asset based on its cost, salvage value, anticipated life, and a "
"particular period. This method accelerates the rate of the depreciation, so "
"that more depreciation expense occurs in earlier periods than in later ones. "
"The depreciable cost is the actual cost minus the salvage value. The useful "
"life is the number of periods (typically years) over which the asset is "
"depreciated."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon SYD() reekt de \"sum-of-years digits\"-Afschrieven "
"(Aritmeetsch-degressiv Afschrieven) för en Anlaag ut, baseert op ehr Kösten, "
"Restweert, verwacht Looptiet un en Afschrievenperiood. Dat gifft en höger "
"Afschrievengraad, so dat de Kösten för de fröher Perioden grötter sünd as "
"för de laten. De afschriefbor Kösten sünd de aktuellen Kösten ahn Restweert. "
"De Bruukduer is de Tall vun Perioden (normalerwies Johren), över de de "
"Anlaag afschreven warrt."

#: functions/financial.xml:1247
msgid "SYD(cost; salvage value; life; period)"
msgstr "SYD(Kösten; Restweert; Looptiet; Periood)"

#: functions/financial.xml:1248
msgid "SYD(5000; 200; 5; 2) equals 1280"
msgstr "SYD(5000; 200; 5; 2) gifft \"1280\" torüch"

#: functions/financial.xml:1270
msgid ""
"The TBILLEQ functions returns the bond equivalent for a treasury bill. The "
"maturity date must be after the settlement date but within 365 days."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon TBILLEQ gifft de passen Obligatschoon för en Schattbreef "
"torüch. Dat Afloopdatum mutt na't Utbetahldatum liggen, man binnen 365 Daag."

#: functions/financial.xml:1271
msgid "TBILLEQ(settlement; maturity; discount)"
msgstr "TBILLEQ(Utbetahldatum; Afloopdatum; Diskontsatz)"

#: functions/financial.xml:1272
msgid "TBILLEQ(\"2/28/2001\"; \"8/31/2001\"; 0.1) returns 0.1068"
msgstr "TBILLEQ(\"2/28/2001\"; \"8/31/2001\"; 0.1) gifft \"0.1068\" torüch"

#: functions/financial.xml:1294
msgid ""
"The TBILLPRICE functions returns the price per $100 value for a treasury "
"bill. The maturity date must be after the settlement date but within 365 "
"days. The discount rate must be positive."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon TBILLPRICE gifft den Pries per 100 Dollar Weert för en "
"Schattbreef torüch. Dat Afloopdatum mutt na't Utbetahldatum liggen, man "
"binnen 365 Daag. De Diskontsatz mutt positiv wesen."

#: functions/financial.xml:1295
msgid "TBILLPRICE(settlement; maturity; discount)"
msgstr "TBILLPRICE(Utbetahldatum; Afloopdatum; Diskontsatz)"

#: functions/financial.xml:1296
msgid "TBILLPRICE(\"2/28/2001\"; \"8/31/2001\"; 0.05) returns 97.4444"
msgstr ""
"TBILLPRICE(\"2/28/2001\"; \"8/31/2001\"; 0.05) gifft \"97.4444\" torüch"

#: functions/financial.xml:1318
msgid ""
"The TBILLYIELD functions returns the yield for a treasury bill. The maturity "
"date must be after the settlement date but within 365 days. The price must "
"be positive."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon TBILLYIELD gifft de Büüt för en Schattbreef torüch. Dat "
"Afloopdatum mutt na't Utbetahldatum liggen, man binnen 365 Daag. De Pries "
"mutt positiv wesen."

#: functions/financial.xml:1319
msgid "TBILLYIELD(settlement; maturity; price)"
msgstr "TBILLYIELD(Utbetahldatum; Afloopdatum; Pries)"

#: functions/financial.xml:1320
msgid "TBILLYIELD(\"2/28/2001\"; \"8/31/2001\"; 600) returns -1.63"
msgstr "TBILLYIELD(\"2/28/2001\"; \"8/31/2001\"; 600) gifft \"-1.63\" torüch"

#: functions/financial.xml:1350
msgid ""
"VDB calculates the depreciation allowance of an asset with an initial value, "
"an expected useful life, and a final value of salvage for a period "
"specified, using the variable-rate declining balance method."
msgstr ""
"VDB reekt den tolaten Afschrievensatz vun en Anlaag mit en Startweert, en "
"verwacht nütten Looptiet un en Ennweert vun den Restweert för en angeven "
"Periood na de Restweertafschrieven mit variabel Tins ut."

#: functions/financial.xml:1351
msgid ""
"VDB(cost; salvage; life; start-period; end-period; [; depreciation-factor = "
"2 [; switch = false ]] )"
msgstr ""
"VDB(Kösten; Restweert; Looptiet; Startperiood; Ennperiood; [; "
"Afschrievenfaktor = 2 [; Schalter = falsch ]] )"

#: functions/financial.xml:1352
msgid "VDB(10000;600;10;0;0.875;1.5) returns 1312.5"
msgstr "VDB(10000;600;10;0;0.875;1.5) gifft 1312.5 torüch"

#: functions/financial.xml:1364 functions/financial.xml:1391
msgid "Dates"
msgstr "Daten"

#: functions/financial.xml:1372
msgid ""
"The XIRR function calculates the internal rate of return for a non-periodic "
"series of cash flows."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon XIRR reekt den intern Tinsfoot vun en nich-perioodsch Reeg vun "
"Geldströöm ut."

#: functions/financial.xml:1373
msgid "XIRR( Values; Dates[; Guess = 0.1 ] )"
msgstr "XIRR( Weerten; Daten[; Raden = 0.1 ] )"

#: functions/financial.xml:1374
msgid ""
"XIRR(B1:B4;C1:C4) Suppose B1:B4 contains -20000, 4000, 12000, 8000 while C1:"
"C4 contains \"=DATE(2000;1;1)\", \"=DATE(2000;6;1)\", \"=DATE(2000;12;30)\", "
"\"=DATE(2001;3;1)\" returns 0.2115964"
msgstr ""
"XIRR(B1:B4;C1:C4) Annahmen, B1:B4 bargt -20000, 4000, 12000, 8000 un C1:C4 "
"bargt \"=DATE(2000;1;1)\", \"=DATE(2000;6;1)\", \"=DATE(2000;12;30)\", "
"\"=DATE(2001;3;1)\" gifft 0.2115964 torüch."

#: functions/financial.xml:1395
msgid ""
"The XNPV function calculates the net present value of a series of cash flows."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon XNPV reekt den Kapitaalweert vun en Reeg vun Geldfleten ut."

#: functions/financial.xml:1396
msgid "XNPV( Rate; Values; Dates )"
msgstr "XNPV( Tins; Weerten; Daten )"

#: functions/financial.xml:1397
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"XNPV(5%;B1:B4;C1:C4) suppose B1:B4 contains -20000, 4000, 12000, 8000 while "
"C1:C4 contains \"=DATE(2000;1;1)\", \"=DATE(2000;6;1)\", \"=DATE"
"(2000;12;30)\", \"=DATE(2001;3;1)\" returns 2907.83187"
msgstr ""
"XNPV(5%;B1:B4;C1:C4) annahmen, B1:B4 bargt -20000, 4000, 12000, 8000 un C1:"
"C4 bargt \"=DATE(2000;1;1)\", \"=DATE(2000;6;1)\", \"=DATE(2000;12;30)\", "
"\"=DATE(2001;3;1)\" gifft 2907.83187 torüch"

#: functions/financial.xml:1426
msgid ""
"YIELDDISC calculates the yield of a discounted security per 100 currency "
"units of face value."
msgstr ""
"YIELDDISC reekt den Winn vun en diskonteert Weertpapeer per 100 "
"Geldeenheiten vun den Nennweert ut."

#: functions/financial.xml:1427
msgid "YIELDDISC(settlement; maturity; price, redemp, basis)"
msgstr "YIELDDISC(Utbetahldatum; Afloopdatum; Pries; Inlösen; Basis)"

#: functions/financial.xml:1428
msgid ""
"YIELDDISC(DATE(1990;6;1);DATE(1990;12;31);941.66667;1000) returns 0.106194684"
msgstr ""
"YIELDDISC(DATE(1990;6;1);DATE(1990;12;31);941.66667;1000) gifft 0.106194684 "
"torüch."

#: functions/financial.xml:1460
msgid ""
"The YIELDMAT function calculates the yield of the security that pays "
"interest on the maturity date."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon YIELDMAT reekt den Winn vun dat Weertpapeer ut, för dat an't "
"Afloopdatum Tinsen betahlt warrt."

#: functions/financial.xml:1461
msgid "YIELDMAT( Settlement; Maturity; Issue; Rate; Price; Basis )"
msgstr "YIELDMAT(Utbetahldatum; Afloopdatum; Utgaav; Tins; Pries; Basis)"

#: functions/financial.xml:1462
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"YIELDMAT(DATE(1990;6;1);DATE(1995;12;31);DATE(1990; 1; 1); 6%;103.819218241) "
"returns 0.050000000"
msgstr ""
"YIELDMAT(DATE(1990;6;1);DATE(1995;12;31);DATE(1990; 1; 1); 6%;103.819218241) "
"gifft 0.050000000 torüch."

#: functions/financial.xml:1485
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The ZERO_COUPON() function calculates the value of a zero-coupon (pure "
"discount) bond. For example: if the interest rate is 10%, a $1000 bond that "
"matures in 20 years is worth ZERO_COUPON(1000;.1;20) or $148.64."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon ZERO_COUPON() reekt den Weert vun en Nullkuponanlehn (aftinst "
"Anlehn) ut. Bispill: Wenn de Tinssatz 10% is, denn is en Anlehn vun 1000 "
"Dollar, de na 20 Johren tahlbor is, ZERO_COUPON(1000;.1;20) oder 148,64 "
"Dollar weert."

#: functions/financial.xml:1486
msgid "ZERO_COUPON(face value;rate;years)"
msgstr "ZERO_COUPON(Nennweert;Tins;Johren)"

#: functions/financial.xml:1487
msgid "ZERO_COUPON(1000;.1;20) equals 148.64"
msgstr "ZERO_COUPON(1000;0,1;20) gifft \"148,64\" torüch"

#: functions/information.cpp:193 part/dialogs/PreferenceDialog.cpp:459
msgid "Manual"
msgstr "Vun Hand"

#: functions/information.xml:15
msgid ""
"The ERRORTYPE() function converts a error to a number. If the value is not "
"an error, an error is returned. Otherwise, a numerical code is returned. "
"Error codes are modelled on Excel."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon ERRORTYPE() wannelt en Fehler na en Tall üm. Wenn de Weert "
"keen Fehler is, warrt en Fehler torüchgeven. Anners warrt en numeersch Kode "
"torüchgeven. Fehlerkodes sünd liek den Excel-Standard."

#: functions/information.xml:16
msgid "ERRORTYPE(value)"
msgstr "ERRORTYPE(Weert)"

#: functions/information.xml:17
msgid "ERRORTYPE(NA()) returns 7"
msgstr "ERRORTYPE(NA()) gifft 7 torüch"

#: functions/information.xml:18
msgid "ERRORTYPE(0) returns an error"
msgstr "ERRORTYPE(0) gifft en Fehler torüch"

#: functions/information.xml:26 functions/reference.xml:48
#: functions/reference.xml:80 functions/reference.xml:97
#: functions/reference.xml:113 functions/reference.xml:136
#: functions/reference.xml:155 functions/reference.xml:172
msgid "Reference"
msgstr "Betog"

#: functions/information.xml:30
msgid "The FORMULA() function returns the formula of a cell as string."
msgstr "De Funkschoon FORMULA() gifft en Zell ehr Formel as Tekenkeed torüch."

#: functions/information.xml:31
msgid "FORMULA(x)"
msgstr "FORMULA(x)"

#: functions/information.xml:32
msgid ""
"FORMULA(A1) returns \"=SUM(1+2)\" if the cell A1 contains such a formula."
msgstr ""
"FORMULA(A1) gifft \"=SUM(1+2)\" torüch, wenn Zell A1 so en Formel bargt."

#: functions/information.xml:44
msgid ""
"The N() function converts a value to a number. If value is or refers to a "
"number, this function returns the number. If value is True, this function "
"returns 1. If a value is a date, this function returns the serial number of "
"that date. Anything else will cause the function to return 0."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon N() reekt en Weert na en Tall üm. Wenn de Weert en Tall is "
"oder na en Tall verwiest, gifft disse Funkschoon en Tall torüch. Wenn de "
"Weert wohr is, warrt \"1\" torüchgeven. Wenn de Weert en Datum is, gifft de "
"Funkschoon de Reegnummer vun't Datum torüch. För all anner Weerten warrt "
"\"0\" torüchgeven."

#: functions/information.xml:45
msgid "N(value)"
msgstr "N(Weert)"

#: functions/information.xml:46
msgid "N(3.14) returns 3.14"
msgstr "N(3,14) gifft \"3,14\" torüch"

#: functions/information.xml:47
msgid "N(\"7\") returns 0 (because \"7\" is text)"
msgstr "N(\"7\") gifft \"0\" torüch (wiel \"7\" Text is)"

#: functions/information.xml:55
msgid "Type of information"
msgstr "Informatschoon-Typ"

#: functions/information.xml:59
msgid ""
"The INFO() function returns information about the current operating "
"environment. Parameter type specifies what type of information you want to "
"return. It is one of the following: \"directory\" returns the path of the "
"current directory, \"numfile\" returns the number of active documents, "
"\"release\" returns the version of KCells as text, \"recalc\" returns the "
"current recalculation mode: \"Automatic\" or \"Manual\", \"system\" returns "
"the name of the operating environment, \"osversion\" returns the current "
"operating system."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon INFO() gifft Informatschonen över de aktuell Bedriefümgeven "
"torüch. De Parameter \"Typ\" leggt de Oort vun torüchgeven Informatschonen "
"fast. Mööglich Weerten sünd: \"directory\" gifft den aktuellen Orner sien "
"Padd torüch, \"numfile\" gifft de Tall vun aktiv Dokmenten torüch, \"release"
"\" gifft de Verschoon vun KCells as Text ut, \"recalc\" gifft de aktuell "
"Niegutrekenmetood torüch: \"Automaatsch\" oder \"vun Hand\", \"system\" "
"gifft den Bedriefümgeven-Naam torüch un \"osversion\" dat aktuelle "
"Bedriefsysteem."

#: functions/information.xml:60
msgid "INFO(type)"
msgstr "INFO(Typ)"

#: functions/information.xml:68 functions/information.xml:83
#: functions/information.xml:98 functions/information.xml:114
#: functions/information.xml:130 functions/information.xml:145
#: functions/information.xml:160 functions/information.xml:175
#: functions/information.xml:190 functions/information.xml:206
#: functions/information.xml:222 functions/information.xml:237
#: functions/information.xml:252 functions/information.xml:267
#: functions/information.xml:282 functions/information.xml:309
msgid "Any value"
msgstr "Jichtenseen Weert"

#: functions/information.xml:72
msgid ""
"The ISLOGICAL() function returns True if the parameter is a boolean value. "
"Otherwise it returns False."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon ISLOGICAL() gifft \"wohr\" torüch, wenn de Parameter en "
"boolsch Weert is. Anners warrt \"falsch\" torüchgeven."

#: functions/information.xml:73
msgid "ISLOGICAL(x)"
msgstr "ISLOGICAL(x)"

#: functions/information.xml:74
msgid "ISLOGICAL(A1>A2) returns True"
msgstr "ISLOGICAL(A1>A2) gifft \"wohr\" torüch"

#: functions/information.xml:75
msgid "ISLOGICAL(12) returns False"
msgstr "ISLOGICAL(12) gifft \"falsch\" torüch"

#: functions/information.xml:87
msgid ""
"The ISBLANK() function returns True if the parameter is empty. Otherwise it "
"returns False."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon ISBLANK() gifft \"wohr\" torüch, wenn de Parameter leddig is. "
"Anners warrt \"falsch\" torüchgeven."

#: functions/information.xml:88
msgid "ISBLANK(x)"
msgstr "ISBLANK(x)"

#: functions/information.xml:89
