msgid "RANDPOISSON(x)"
msgstr "RANDPOISSON(x)"

#: functions/math.xml:973
msgid "RANDPOISSON(4)"
msgstr "RANDPOISSON(4)"

#: functions/math.xml:982 functions/math.xml:1002 functions/math.xml:1022
msgid "A floating point value (between 0 and 1)"
msgstr "En Fleetkommaweert (twischen 0 un 1)"

#: functions/math.xml:986
msgid "Trials (greater 0)"
msgstr "Versöken (grötter as 0)"

#: functions/math.xml:990
msgid ""
"The RANDBINOM() function returns a binomially-distributed pseudo-random "
"number."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon RANDBINOM() gifft en binoomsch verdeelt pseudo-tofällig Tall "
"torüch."

#: functions/math.xml:991
msgid "RANDBINOM(x)"
msgstr "RANDBINOM(x)"

#: functions/math.xml:992
msgid "RANDBINOM(4)"
msgstr "RANDBINOM(4)"

#: functions/math.xml:1006
msgid "Failures (greater 0)"
msgstr "Fehlers (grötter as 0)"

#: functions/math.xml:1010
msgid ""
"The RANDNEGBINOM() function returns a negative binomially-distributed pseudo-"
"random number."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon RANDNEGBINOM() gifft en negativ binoomsch verdeelt pseudo-"
"tofällig Tall torüch."

#: functions/math.xml:1011
msgid "RANDNEGBINOM(x)"
msgstr "RANDNEGBINOM(x)"

#: functions/math.xml:1012
msgid "RANDNEGBINOM(4)"
msgstr "RANDNEGBINOM(4)"

#: functions/math.xml:1030
msgid ""
"The RANDBERNOULLI() function returns a Bernoulli-distributed pseudo-random "
"number."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon RANDBERNOULLI() gifft en \"Bernoulli\"-verdeelt pseudo-"
"tofällig Tall torüch."

#: functions/math.xml:1031
msgid "RANDBERNOULLI(x)"
msgstr "RANDBERNOULLI(x)"

#: functions/math.xml:1032
msgid "RANDBERNOULLI(0.45)"
msgstr "RANDBERNOULLI(0.45)"

#: functions/math.xml:1041
msgid "Mean value of the normal distribution"
msgstr "Middelweert vun de Normaalverdelen"

#: functions/math.xml:1045
msgid "Dispersion of the normal distribution"
msgstr "Streuen vun de Normaalverdelen"

#: functions/math.xml:1049
msgid ""
"The RANDNORM() function returns a Normal(Gaussian)-distributed pseudo-random "
"number."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon RANDNORM() gifft en normaal (gauß'sch) verdeelt pseudo-"
"tofällig Tall torüch."

#: functions/math.xml:1050
msgid "RANDNORM(mu; sigma)"
msgstr "RANDNORM(mü; sigma)"

#: functions/math.xml:1051
msgid "RANDNORM(0; 1)"
msgstr "RANDNORM(0; 1)"

#: functions/math.xml:1060
msgid "Bottom value"
msgstr "Sietst Weert"

#: functions/math.xml:1064
msgid "Top value"
msgstr "Böverst Weert"

#: functions/math.xml:1068
msgid ""
"The RANDBETWEEN() function returns a pseudo-random number between bottom and "
"top value. If bottom > top this function returns Err."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon RANDBETWEEN() gifft en pseudo-tofällig Tall twischen sietst un "
"böverst Weert torüch. Wenn de sietst Weert grötter as de böverst Weert is "
"warrt \"Err\" (Fehler) torüchgeven."

#: functions/math.xml:1069
msgid "RANDBETWEEN(bottom;top)"
msgstr "RANDBETWEEN(sietst;böverst)"

#: functions/math.xml:1070
msgid "RANDBETWEEN(12;78) equals for example 61.0811..."
msgstr "RANDBETWEEN(12;78) gifft a.B.\" 61,0811\" torüch..."

#: functions/math.xml:1082
msgid "Multiple"
msgstr "Veelfachet"

#: functions/math.xml:1086
msgid ""
"The MROUND() function returns the value rounded to the specified multiple. "
"The value and the multiple must have the same sign"
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon MROUND() gifft de na en angeven Veelfachet rundt Weert torüch. "
"Weert un Produkt mööt de sülven Vörtekens hebben."

#: functions/math.xml:1087
msgid "MROUND(value; multiple)"
msgstr "MROUND(Weert; Veelfachet)"

#: functions/math.xml:1088
msgid "MROUND(1.252; 0.5) equals 1.5"
msgstr "MROUND(1.252; 0.5) gifft \"1.5\" torüch"

#: functions/math.xml:1089
msgid "MROUND(-1.252; -0.5) equals -1.5"
msgstr "MROUND(-1.252; -0.5) gifft \"-1.5\" torüch"

#: functions/math.xml:1102 functions/math.xml:1127 functions/math.xml:1150
msgid "Digits"
msgstr "Steden"

#: functions/math.xml:1106
msgid ""
"The ROUND(value;[digits]) function returns value rounded. Digits is the "
"number of digits to which you want to round that number. If digits is zero "
"or omitted, value is rounded up to the nearest integer. If digits is smaller "
"than zero, the corresponding integer part of the number is rounded."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon ROUND(Weert;[Steden]) gifft en rundt Weert torüch. \"Steden\" "
"is de Tall vun Nakommasteden, na de de Tall rundt warrn schall. Wenn \"Steden"
"\" Null oder weglaten is, warrt \"Weert\" na de dichtst bi leggen Heeltall "
"rundt. Wenn \"Steden\" lütter as Null is, warrt de Tall ehr tohören "
"Heeltalldeel rundt."

#: functions/math.xml:1107
msgid "ROUND(value;[digits])"
msgstr "ROUND(Weert;[Steden])"

#: functions/math.xml:1108
msgid "ROUND(1.252;2) equals 1.25"
msgstr "ROUND(1,252;2) gifft \"1,25\" torüch"

#: functions/math.xml:1109
msgid "ROUND(-1.252;2) equals -1.25"
msgstr "ROUND(-1,252;2) gifft \"-1,25\" torüch"

#: functions/math.xml:1110
msgid "ROUND(1.258;2) equals 1.26"
msgstr "ROUND(1,258;2) gifft \"1,26\" torüch"

#: functions/math.xml:1111
msgid "ROUND(-12.25;-1) equals -10"
msgstr "ROUND(-12,25;-1) gifft \"-10\" torüch"

#: functions/math.xml:1112
msgid "ROUND(-1.252;0) equals -1"
msgstr "ROUND(-1,252;0) gifft \"-1\" torüch"

#: functions/math.xml:1131
msgid ""
"The ROUNDUP(value;[digits]) function returns value rounded so that its "
"absolute value is greater. Digits is the number of digits to which you want "
"to round that number. If digits is zero or omitted, value is rounded up to "
"the nearest integer."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon ROUNDUP(Weert;[Steden]) gifft en rundt Weert mit en "
"grötterafsoluut Weert torüch. De Tall warrt na \"Steden\", wat de Tall vun "
"Nakommasteden is, rundt. Is \"Steden\" Null oder weglaten, warrt \"Weert\" "
"na de dichtst bi leggen Heeltall oprundt."

#: functions/math.xml:1132
msgid "ROUNDUP(value;[digits])"
msgstr "ROUNDUP(Weert;[Steden])"

#: functions/math.xml:1133
msgid "ROUNDUP(1.252) equals 2"
msgstr "ROUNDUP(1.252) gifft \"2\" torüch"

#: functions/math.xml:1134
msgid "ROUNDUP(1.252;2) equals 1.26"
msgstr "ROUNDUP(1,252;2) gifft \"1,26\" torüch"

#: functions/math.xml:1135
msgid "ROUNDUP(-1.252;2) equals -1.26"
msgstr "ROUNDUP(-1.252;2) gifft \"-1.26\" torüch"

#: functions/math.xml:1136
msgid "ROUNDUP(-1.252) equals -2"
msgstr "ROUNDUP(-1,252) gifft \"-2\" torüch"

#: functions/math.xml:1154
msgid ""
"The ROUNDDOWN(value;[digits]) function returns value rounded so that its "
"absolute value is lesser. Digits is the number of digits to which you want "
"to round that number. If digits is zero or omitted, value is rounded down to "
"the nearest integer."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon ROUNDDOWN(Weert;[Steden]) gifft en rundt Weert mit en lütter "
"afsoluut Weert torüch. De Tall warrt na \"Steden\", wat de Tall vun "
"Nakommasteden is, rundt. Is \"Steden\" Null oder weglaten, warrt \"Weert\" "
"na de dichtst bi leggen Heeltall afrundt."

#: functions/math.xml:1155
msgid "ROUNDDOWN(value;[digits])"
msgstr "ROUNDDOWN(Weert; [Steden])"

#: functions/math.xml:1156
msgid "ROUNDDOWN(1.252) equals 1"
msgstr "ROUNDDOWN(1,252) gifft \"1\" torüch"

#: functions/math.xml:1157
msgid "ROUNDDOWN(1.252;2) equals 1.25"
msgstr "ROUNDDOWN(1,252;2) gifft \"1,25\" torüch"

#: functions/math.xml:1158
msgid "ROUNDDOWN(-1.252;2) equals -1.25"
msgstr "ROUNDDOWN(-1,252;2) gifft \"-1,25\" torüch"

#: functions/math.xml:1159
msgid "ROUNDDOWN(-1.252) equals -1"
msgstr "ROUNDDOWN(-1,252) gifft \"-1\" torüch"

#: functions/math.xml:1169
msgid "Nth term"
msgstr "n-t Term"

#: functions/math.xml:1173
msgid ""
"Function FIB calculates the Nth term of a Fibonacci sequence (1, 1, 2, 3, 5, "
"8, 13, 21...), in which each number, after the first two, is the sum of the "
"two numbers immediately preceding it. FIB(0) is defined to be 0."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon FIB reekt den n-t Term vun en Fibonacci-Reeg (1, 1, 2, 3, 5, "
"8, 13, 21...) ut, binnen de elk Tall na de eersten twee Tallen de Summ vun "
"de beden verleden Tallen is. FIB(0) warrt as 0 fastleggt."

#: functions/math.xml:1174
msgid "FIB(n)"
msgstr "FIB(n)"

#: functions/math.xml:1175
msgid "FIB(9) returns 34"
msgstr "FIB(9) gifft \"34\" torüch"

#: functions/math.xml:1176
msgid "FIB(26) returns 121393"
msgstr "FIB(26) gifft \"121393\" torüch"

#: functions/math.xml:1184
msgid "Numerator"
msgstr "Teller"

#: functions/math.xml:1188
msgid "Denumerator"
msgstr "Nenner"

#: functions/math.xml:1192
msgid "Function QUOTIENT returns the integer portion of numerator/denumerator."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon QUOTIENT() gifft den Heeltalldeel vun Teller/Nenner torüch."

#: functions/math.xml:1193
msgid "QUOTIENT(numerator;denumerator)"
msgstr "QUOTIENT(Teller;Nenner)"

#: functions/math.xml:1194
msgid "QUOTIENT(21;4) returns 5"
msgstr "QUOTIENT(21;4) gifft \"5\" torüch"

#: functions/math.xml:1207
msgid ""
"Function MDETERM returns the determinant of a given matrix. The matrix must "
"be of type n x n."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon MDETERM gifft de Determinant vun en angeven Matrix torüch. De "
"Matrix mutt vun den Typ n x n wesen."

#: functions/math.xml:1208
msgid "MDETERM(matrix)"
msgstr "MDETERM(Matrix)"

#: functions/math.xml:1209
msgid "MDETERM(A1:C3)"
msgstr "MDETERM(A1:C3)"

#: functions/math.xml:1218
msgid "First matrix"
msgstr "Eerst Matrix"

#: functions/math.xml:1222
msgid "Second matrix"
msgstr "Tweet Matrix"

#: functions/math.xml:1226
msgid ""
"Function MMULT multiplies two matrices. Number of columns of the first "
"matrix must be the same as row count of the second one. The result is a "
"matrix."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon MMULT nimmt twee Matrizen mitenanner maal. De eersten Matrix "
"ehr Tall vun Striepen mutt de sülve wesen as de twete Matrix ehr Tall vun "
"Regen. Dat Resultaat is en Matrix."

#: functions/math.xml:1227
msgid "MMULT(matrix1;matrix2)"
msgstr "MMULT(Matrix1;Matrix2)"

#: functions/math.xml:1228
msgid "MMULT(A1:C3)"
msgstr "MMULT(A1:C3)"

#: functions/math.xml:1237 functions/math.xml:1270
msgid "Matrix"
msgstr "Matrix"

#: functions/math.xml:1241
msgid "Calculates the inverse of the matrix."
msgstr "Reekt de Inverschoon vun de Matrix ut."

#: functions/math.xml:1242
msgid ""
"The matrix multiplied with its inverse results in the unity matrix of the "
"same dimension."
msgstr ""
"De Matrix, mit ehr Inverschoon maalnahmen, gifft de Eenheitmatrix vun de "
"sülve Afmeten."

#: functions/math.xml:1243
msgid "Invertible matrices have a non-zero determinant."
msgstr "Inverteerbor Matrizen hebbt en anner Determinant as Null."

#: functions/math.xml:1244
msgid "MINVERSE(matrix)"
msgstr "MINVERSE(Matrix)"

#: functions/math.xml:1245
msgid "MINVERSE(A1:C3)"
msgstr "MINVERSE(A1:C3)"

#: functions/math.xml:1255
