msgid "KURT(A1:A5)"
msgstr "KURT(A1:A5)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:626
msgid "KURT(21; 33; 54; 23) returns 1.344239"
msgstr "KURT(21; 33; 54; 23) gifft \"1.344239\" torüch"

#: functions/statistical.xml:655
msgid ""
"The KURTP() function calculates an population kurtosis of a data set. You "
"have to provide at least 4 values, otherwise an error is returned."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon KURTP() reekt en Populatschoon-Timp vun en Datensett ut. Warrt "
