msgstr "PEARSON(Rebeet1; Rebeet2)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:922
msgid "PEARSON(A1:A3; B1:B3)"
msgstr "PEARSON(A1:A3; B1:B3)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:935
msgid "Number of elements to permutate"
msgstr "Tall vun Elementen för't Permuteren"

#: functions/statistical.xml:939
msgid ""
"The PERMUT() function returns the number of permutations. The first "
"parameter is the number of elements, and the second parameter is the number "
"of elements used in the permutation."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon PERMUT() gifft de Tall vun Permutatschonen (Ännern) torüch. De "
"eerste Parameter is de Tall vun Elementen, de twete de Tall vun Elementen "
"för de Permutatschoon."

#: functions/statistical.xml:940
msgid "PERMUT(total;permutated)"
msgstr "PERMUT(tosamen;bruukt)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:941
msgid "PERMUT(8;5) equals 6720"
msgstr "PERMUT(8;5) gifft \"6720\" torüch"

#: functions/statistical.xml:942
msgid "PERMUT(1;1) equals 1"
msgstr "PERMUT(1;1) gifft \"1\" torüch"

#: functions/statistical.xml:950
msgid "Range of values"
msgstr "Weertenrebeet"

#: functions/statistical.xml:954
msgid "The percentile value between 0 and 1, inclusive."
msgstr "De Perzentil-Weert vun 0 bet 1."

#: functions/statistical.xml:958
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The PERCENTILE() function returns the x-th sample percentile of data values "
"in Data. A percentile returns the scale value for a data series which goes "
"from the smallest (alpha=0) to the largest value (alpha=1) of a data series. "
"For alpha = 25%, the percentile means the first quartile; alpha = 50% is the "
"MEDIAN. Blank cells will be considered as a zero, and cells with text will "
"be ignored."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon PERCENTILE() gifft dat x-te Musterperzentil vun Datenweerten "
"binnen \"Daten\" torüch. En Perzentil gifft en Skalenweert vun en Datenreeg "
"ehr lüttsten (alpha=0) bet na ehr gröttsten (alpha=1) Weert ut. Is alpha = "
"25%, denn bedüüdt \"Perzentil\" dat eerste Quantil; alpha = 50% is de "
"Dörsnitt. Leddig Zellen warrt as Null ankeken, un Textzellen warrt övergahn."

#: functions/statistical.xml:959
msgid "PERCENTILE(data;alpha)"
msgstr "PERCENTILE(Daten;alpha)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:969
msgid ""
"The number for which the standard normal distribution is to be calculated"
msgstr "De Tall, de ehr Standard-Normaalverdelen utreekt warrn schall"

#: functions/statistical.xml:973
msgid ""
"The PHI() function returns value of the distribution function for a standard "
"normal distribution."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon PHI() gifft den Weert vun de Verdelenfunkschoon för en "
"Standard-Normaalverdelen torüch."

#: functions/statistical.xml:974
msgid "PHI(value)"
msgstr "PHI(Weert)"

