#: part/dialogs/InterfaceOptionsWidget.ui:115
msgid ""
"Click here to change the grid color ie the color of the borders of each cell."
msgstr ""
"Klick hier, wenn Du de Gadderklöör ännern wullt, a.B. de Zellengrenzen ehr "
"Klören."

