#: part/dialogs/InterfaceOptionsWidget.ui:212
msgid "Page border:"
msgstr "Sietrand:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KColorCombo, m_pageBorderColor)
#: part/dialogs/InterfaceOptionsWidget.ui:222
msgid ""
"When the View ->Show Page Borders menu item is checked, the page borders are "
"displayed. Click here to choose another color for the borders than the "
"default red."
msgstr ""
"Is de Menüpunkt \"Ansicht -> Siedenränners\" anmaakt, warrt de Siedenränners "
"wiest. Klick hier, wenn Du en anner Klöör as dat Standardroot för de Ränners "
"bruken wullt."

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, m_captureAllArrowKeys)
#: part/dialogs/InterfaceOptionsWidget.ui:322
msgid ""
"Captures all navigation keys, i.e. the arrow keys, page up/down, tabulator "
"and backward tabulator key, while editing a cell with the embedded editor. "
"The embedded editor is the one appearing directly in the cell. If captured, "
"these keys are used for navigating in the editor. Otherwise, they are used "
"for cell navigation."
msgstr ""
"Fangt bi't Bewerken vun en Zell mit den inbett Editor all Stüertasten af, a."
"B. de Pieltasten, SietRop/-Daal, Tabulater- un Tabulater-Torüchtast. De "
"inbett Editor dukt direktemang binnen de Zell op. De affungen Tasten warrt "
"för't Stüern mit den Editor bruukt. Anners warrt se för't Zellen-Navigeren "
"bruukt."

